+// gc-spill-pointers (private jank patch) runs flatten + spill-pointers only in
+// functions that can transitively reach a collector seed, and only around call
+// sites that can. Indirect calls resolve by signature to table functions;
+// call_ref, unresolved signatures and imports not marked safe are assumed to
+// collect. This assumes JS does not add functions to the table at runtime.
